1
00:00:12,730 --> 00:00:15,550
♪I lean and gaze at misty waves afar♪

2
00:00:16,010 --> 00:00:18,320
♪Tears fall on the ancient road
'neath the setting sun♪

3
00:00:19,330 --> 00:00:21,460
♪One lone shadow on the cold river♪

4
00:00:21,460 --> 00:00:23,910
♪In dreams, I return to the old window♪

5
00:00:25,840 --> 00:00:28,670
♪Mountains stretch, the road home fades♪

6
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:32,030
♪A flute cries out, hooves hurry on♪

7
00:00:32,460 --> 00:00:34,790
♪My heart adrift beneath a frosted moon♪

8
00:00:34,820 --> 00:00:38,220
♪Drinking alone, I mourn our parting♪

9
00:00:38,370 --> 00:00:40,050
♪Night turns cold, wind stirs the veil♪

10
00:00:40,060 --> 00:00:41,760
♪Old robes recall forgotten days♪

11
00:00:41,760 --> 00:00:43,570
♪Heart sore, a lone goose flies south♪

12
00:00:43,580 --> 00:00:45,230
♪Where shall I send this letter?♪

13
00:00:45,230 --> 00:00:47,760
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

14
00:00:47,770 --> 00:00:49,000
♪Love runs deep, dreams linger on♪

15
00:00:49,000 --> 00:00:51,390
♪Only sorrow remains♪

16
00:00:51,640 --> 00:00:53,340
♪A cup of wine, my shadow makes us two♪

17
00:00:53,350 --> 00:00:54,980
♪Drunk and lost through flashing blades♪

18
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,870
♪I curse how swiftly the years pass by♪

19
00:00:56,880 --> 00:00:58,580
♪The wandering road goes on♪

20
00:00:58,590 --> 00:01:01,020
♪Desolate, time frosts my youthful hair♪

21
00:01:01,030 --> 00:01:02,340
♪Through the years, love still burns♪

22
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,530
♪A thousand tears fall♪

23
00:01:04,800 --> 00:01:08,030
♪Worlds apart, tears stain my sleeves♪

24
00:01:08,150 --> 00:01:11,300
♪Old dreams haunt my heart,
tears cloud my eyes♪

25
00:01:11,460 --> 00:01:13,340
♪Heartbroken, soul-worn,
pain won't fade♪

26
00:01:13,340 --> 00:01:14,820
♪Moonlight westward, the night drags on♪

27
00:01:14,830 --> 00:01:17,920
♪The years have left their scars♪

28
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:21,280
♪Autumn winds sweep leaves;
shadows pair♪

29
00:01:21,440 --> 00:01:24,590
♪The past fades like smoke;
tears fall♪

30
00:01:24,740 --> 00:01:26,820
♪My heart lies broken♪

31
00:01:26,830 --> 00:01:30,150
♪Lost in thought through endless nights♪

32
00:01:30,150 --> 00:01:34,980
[Love Legend]

33
00:01:35,100 --> 00:01:38,780
[Episode 15]

34
00:02:07,070 --> 00:02:08,190
Why are you still here?

35
00:02:08,470 --> 00:02:09,400
I was just

36
00:02:09,400 --> 00:02:10,800
worried about you.

37
00:02:12,910 --> 00:02:13,710
Liar.

38
00:02:14,890 --> 00:02:16,080
My feelings for you

39
00:02:16,080 --> 00:02:17,120
are plain for all to see.

40
00:02:21,170 --> 00:02:21,910
Jin.

41
00:02:23,460 --> 00:02:25,210
If only I'd never entered the palace.

42
00:02:27,600 --> 00:02:28,710
Well...

43
00:02:29,960 --> 00:02:32,580
But you did

44
00:02:33,310 --> 00:02:34,390
and became the Noble Consort.

45
00:02:35,360 --> 00:02:36,080
So you must

46
00:02:36,290 --> 00:02:38,510
think more about the Crown Prince.

47
00:02:39,150 --> 00:02:40,310
What did His Majesty say

48
00:02:40,310 --> 00:02:41,280
about the marriage?

49
00:02:42,250 --> 00:02:43,520
He said he'd think about it.

50
00:02:45,150 --> 00:02:45,710
Mm.

51
00:02:45,980 --> 00:02:47,360
This is a crucial time.

52
00:02:47,510 --> 00:02:49,330
We must be careful.

53
00:02:51,100 --> 00:02:52,730
Why so tender today?

54
00:02:53,460 --> 00:02:54,900
Do you have something to say?

55
00:02:55,370 --> 00:02:55,950
Say it.

56
00:02:58,850 --> 00:02:59,580
I just

57
00:02:59,880 --> 00:03:00,770
received a secret report.

58
00:03:01,770 --> 00:03:04,840
Pei Zhao is probing Qingyan's origins.

59
00:03:09,540 --> 00:03:12,220
[Fengyi Bureau]

60
00:03:15,740 --> 00:03:18,940
[Pei Qingrui,
Pei Zhao's adoptive father]

61
00:03:18,940 --> 00:03:20,430
You really are Zhao.

62
00:03:20,710 --> 00:03:21,320
It's me.

63
00:03:22,670 --> 00:03:24,210
Good.

64
00:03:25,130 --> 00:03:26,620
You've finally made it.

65
00:03:29,030 --> 00:03:29,630
Dad.

66
00:03:30,190 --> 00:03:31,780
Where have you been all these years?

67
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:33,560
How did you suddenly disappear?

68
00:03:34,870 --> 00:03:36,020
That year,

69
00:03:36,860 --> 00:03:38,130
some men came to the mine.

70
00:03:38,840 --> 00:03:39,530
They called Liu,

71
00:03:40,180 --> 00:03:41,430
Zhang, and I,

72
00:03:41,900 --> 00:03:42,790
into the mine.

73
00:03:43,960 --> 00:03:45,410
They made us smuggle blood jade.

74
00:04:01,370 --> 00:04:02,740
Later, I overheard

75
00:04:03,360 --> 00:04:04,860
they planned to kill us.

76
00:04:05,870 --> 00:04:06,960
So I went back

77
00:04:07,360 --> 00:04:08,370
to warn Liu.

78
00:04:10,070 --> 00:04:11,240
But...

79
00:04:12,870 --> 00:04:13,520
Ah...

80
00:04:16,680 --> 00:04:18,000
When I came to,

81
00:04:18,450 --> 00:04:20,200
I found both legs broken.

82
00:04:21,540 --> 00:04:23,000
The Blood Jade was gone.

83
00:04:23,560 --> 00:04:24,830
I dared not go back.

84
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:29,530
Later, I learned

85
00:04:30,960 --> 00:04:32,160
Liu and the others

86
00:04:32,600 --> 00:04:34,000
had all been killed.

87
00:04:36,070 --> 00:04:37,390
I feared I would drag you down,

88
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,620
so I fled quietly.

89
00:04:41,070 --> 00:04:41,950
I never thought

90
00:04:43,140 --> 00:04:44,240
you would still remember me

91
00:04:45,360 --> 00:04:46,750
and send men to find me.

92
00:04:47,480 --> 00:04:48,310
Good boy.

93
00:04:50,160 --> 00:04:50,870
All these years,

94
00:04:51,680 --> 00:04:52,810
how did you survive?

95
00:04:54,540 --> 00:04:56,350
How did you end up at the Fengyi Bureau?

96
00:04:58,190 --> 00:04:58,790
Dad.

97
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,270
After you left,

98
00:05:01,010 --> 00:05:01,840
I found a way

99
00:05:02,220 --> 00:05:03,860
to study under the mine's drill master.

100
00:05:04,560 --> 00:05:05,660
He saw some talent in me

101
00:05:05,870 --> 00:05:06,690
and took me as his student.

102
00:05:07,630 --> 00:05:08,190
Later,

103
00:05:08,650 --> 00:05:09,860
His Majesty founded the Fengyi Bureau

104
00:05:10,320 --> 00:05:11,500
and recruited anyone with talent.

105
00:05:11,830 --> 00:05:13,070
So I applied.

106
00:05:14,610 --> 00:05:15,530
Good.

107
00:05:16,640 --> 00:05:17,820
You're a good boy.

108
00:05:18,750 --> 00:05:21,270
You deserve what you have now.

109
00:05:22,560 --> 00:05:23,130
Dad.

110
00:05:23,810 --> 00:05:25,710
There's something I need to ask.

111
00:05:29,830 --> 00:05:31,390
About your parents?

112
00:05:33,260 --> 00:05:33,730
Dad.

113
00:05:34,150 --> 00:05:34,890
Think carefully.

114
00:05:35,540 --> 00:05:36,640
The people who abandoned me,

115
00:05:36,980 --> 00:05:38,020
what did they look like?

116
00:05:38,370 --> 00:05:39,460
Their clothes,

117
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:41,140
anything unusual?

118
00:05:43,340 --> 00:05:44,470
That person's face,

119
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:46,920
I can't recall it clearly.

120
00:05:48,230 --> 00:05:49,380
But the clothes

121
00:05:50,410 --> 00:05:51,780
were distinctive.

122
00:05:54,450 --> 00:05:55,010
Lu Li.

123
00:05:56,360 --> 00:05:57,240
Have an artist draw them.

124
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:58,960
Post a large bounty in the Ghost Market.

125
00:05:59,520 --> 00:06:00,430
Yes, sir.

126
00:06:03,000 --> 00:06:03,430
Sir.

127
00:06:04,630 --> 00:06:06,180
The Eastern Palace just sent word.

128
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,600
Tomorrow they'll send gifts

129
00:06:07,600 --> 00:06:08,650
for you and Madam Yun,

130
00:06:09,360 --> 00:06:10,980
to thank you both

131
00:06:10,990 --> 00:06:12,520
for helping at Mingyu Headquarters.

132
00:06:14,090 --> 00:06:15,190
Gifts?

133
00:06:25,270 --> 00:06:26,170
Wow.

134
00:06:27,330 --> 00:06:28,430
The Crown Prince has changed.

135
00:06:29,560 --> 00:06:31,630
He usually doesn't get along with you.

136
00:06:31,630 --> 00:06:33,270
Yet today, he sends so much.

137
00:06:33,760 --> 00:06:34,720
It does feel off.

138
00:06:36,180 --> 00:06:37,430
I think he is after...

139
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:44,940
Why are you looking at me?

140
00:06:45,830 --> 00:06:46,340
Yeah.

141
00:06:46,920 --> 00:06:48,080
Why look at Madam Yun?

142
00:06:49,240 --> 00:06:50,620
Who else? You?

143
00:06:51,160 --> 00:06:52,200
Idiot.

144
00:06:52,680 --> 00:06:53,450
I'm not an idiot.

145
00:06:54,830 --> 00:06:55,950
I really don't get it.

146
00:06:56,120 --> 00:06:57,250
Why Madam Yun?

147
00:06:58,750 --> 00:07:00,200
I think

148
00:07:00,310 --> 00:07:01,510
the Crown Prince likes her.

149
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:03,180
He's always been spoiled.

150
00:07:03,750 --> 00:07:04,510
Whatever he wants,

151
00:07:04,730 --> 00:07:06,630
he asks His Majesty
and the Noble Consort for it.

152
00:07:08,390 --> 00:07:09,430
And if this time,

153
00:07:09,580 --> 00:07:10,650
he asks Noble Consort for...

154
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:14,320
No matter who he is,

155
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:16,520
he can't always get his way.

156
00:07:17,190 --> 00:07:18,480
He can forget it.

157
00:07:19,750 --> 00:07:21,270
What are you all talking about?

158
00:07:22,870 --> 00:07:23,430
Madam Yun.

159
00:07:23,630 --> 00:07:24,160
Do you get it?

160
00:07:24,870 --> 00:07:25,270
Mm.

161
00:07:38,750 --> 00:07:39,240
Sir.

162
00:07:49,310 --> 00:07:50,240
What a prince.

163
00:07:50,270 --> 00:07:51,360
That trap was vicious.

164
00:07:52,190 --> 00:07:53,810
He rigged the mechanism against you.

165
00:07:55,330 --> 00:07:56,150
He tried to kill you.

166
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:02,580
[Guanyin Pavilion]

167
00:08:06,760 --> 00:08:07,680
Lu Li said

168
00:08:07,870 --> 00:08:09,270
the poison was extremely strong.

169
00:08:09,570 --> 00:08:10,830
It kills upon entering the blood.

170
00:08:11,430 --> 00:08:13,120
Luckily, you have the mother-child Gu.

171
00:08:13,830 --> 00:08:15,190
The mother Gu absorbed the poison.

172
00:08:15,800 --> 00:08:16,800
The toxins countered each other

173
00:08:17,190 --> 00:08:18,420
and saved your life.

174
00:08:21,270 --> 00:08:23,190
So I should thank the Gu?

175
00:08:23,190 --> 00:08:24,270
For what?

176
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,430
Neither is any good.

177
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,000
Done.

178
00:08:33,330 --> 00:08:34,630
Still, I don't think

179
00:08:35,280 --> 00:08:36,230
the Crown Prince

180
00:08:37,670 --> 00:08:38,820
did this.

181
00:08:41,160 --> 00:08:42,160
You trust him that much?

182
00:08:43,030 --> 00:08:44,360
That box could hurt you

183
00:08:44,740 --> 00:08:45,570
and it could end me.

184
00:08:47,720 --> 00:08:49,360
The Crown Prince is spoiled,

185
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:51,980
but he doesn't kill innocents.

186
00:08:52,840 --> 00:08:54,250
You know him better than I do.

187
00:08:54,870 --> 00:08:55,320
Mm.

188
00:08:57,320 --> 00:08:58,080
Actually,

189
00:08:58,650 --> 00:09:00,550
I suspect the Yuns.

190
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:02,360
They wanted

191
00:09:03,150 --> 00:09:04,200
you dead.

192
00:09:05,240 --> 00:09:05,730
Yun Shao.

193
00:09:06,750 --> 00:09:07,480
The Yun family

194
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,210
is a dangerous den.

195
00:09:10,270 --> 00:09:11,080
Don't go back.

196
00:09:11,270 --> 00:09:11,960
I must.

197
00:09:15,480 --> 00:09:16,870
The Noble Consort protects them.

198
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,510
No one in the capital dares touch them.

199
00:09:19,600 --> 00:09:20,630
Right now, Yun Qi

200
00:09:21,070 --> 00:09:23,090
is our only lead.

201
00:09:23,740 --> 00:09:24,960
If one blade breaks,

202
00:09:25,240 --> 00:09:26,320
another will replace it.

203
00:09:26,320 --> 00:09:27,440
Then another.

204
00:09:28,160 --> 00:09:29,890
Sooner or later,
whoever's behind this will appear.

205
00:09:30,750 --> 00:09:32,180
But you'll be in danger.

206
00:09:35,960 --> 00:09:36,790
You said

207
00:09:37,550 --> 00:09:38,830
Fengyi Guards don't fear danger.

208
00:09:44,820 --> 00:09:45,810
I joined the Fengyi Guard

209
00:09:46,630 --> 00:09:47,990
for personal reasons.

210
00:09:49,390 --> 00:09:50,870
I wanted to use its power

211
00:09:52,080 --> 00:09:53,920
to get justice
for Yun Xiang and myself.

212
00:09:56,880 --> 00:09:57,710
But now,

213
00:09:59,680 --> 00:10:01,360
I've seen evil run wild

214
00:10:02,180 --> 00:10:03,020
and darkness everywhere.

215
00:10:06,990 --> 00:10:07,340
Sir.

216
00:10:08,810 --> 00:10:09,680
I'll be the blade

217
00:10:10,720 --> 00:10:11,800
that cuts through this darkness.

218
00:10:18,840 --> 00:10:19,340
Yun Shao.

219
00:10:20,580 --> 00:10:21,550
I'll be your shield.

220
00:10:22,410 --> 00:10:23,320
Go ahead without worry.

221
00:10:40,080 --> 00:10:40,790
Outrageous.

222
00:10:41,440 --> 00:10:43,110
He dared act in Eastern Palace's name.

223
00:10:43,870 --> 00:10:44,520
Where is Han Jin?

224
00:10:44,790 --> 00:10:45,380
Go urge him again.

225
00:10:46,000 --> 00:10:46,390
Yes.

226
00:10:46,420 --> 00:10:47,180
No need.

227
00:10:47,320 --> 00:10:48,000
I am here.

228
00:10:59,080 --> 00:11:00,120
Have you lost your mind?

229
00:11:00,510 --> 00:11:01,880
You posed as Qingyan to kill Pei Zhao.

230
00:11:02,770 --> 00:11:04,260
I did it to build Qingyan's authority.

231
00:11:05,600 --> 00:11:06,720
He is too soft by nature.

232
00:11:06,800 --> 00:11:07,790
Once he takes the throne,

233
00:11:08,080 --> 00:11:08,910
if he can't control Pei Zhao,

234
00:11:08,910 --> 00:11:09,770
how will he rule?

235
00:11:10,630 --> 00:11:11,940
Still, you cannot kill him.

236
00:11:12,210 --> 00:11:13,630
Just grant him more favors.

237
00:11:13,770 --> 00:11:14,510
Softhearted nonsense.

238
00:11:15,150 --> 00:11:16,690
He got lucky this time.

239
00:11:16,790 --> 00:11:17,720
You snapped at me?

240
00:11:25,240 --> 00:11:25,910
Jin.

241
00:11:27,200 --> 00:11:28,550
We endured 18 years.

242
00:11:28,870 --> 00:11:29,670
For what?

243
00:11:31,510 --> 00:11:33,080
To see Qingyan grow up

244
00:11:33,080 --> 00:11:34,280
and take the throne.

245
00:11:35,790 --> 00:11:37,270
We're almost there.

246
00:11:37,750 --> 00:11:39,270
Are you going to throw it all away?

247
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,120
Do you have to kill him?

248
00:11:45,120 --> 00:11:45,750
Yes.

249
00:11:46,410 --> 00:11:47,800
He's a rare talent.

250
00:11:52,360 --> 00:11:53,200
Look.

251
00:11:54,630 --> 00:11:55,870
Once Qingyan becomes Emperor,

252
00:11:56,460 --> 00:11:57,790
plenty of talented men

253
00:11:58,010 --> 00:11:58,840
will serve him.

254
00:12:00,370 --> 00:12:01,350
From now on,

255
00:12:01,730 --> 00:12:03,300
leave outside matters to me.

256
00:12:03,630 --> 00:12:04,150
As for you,

257
00:12:04,640 --> 00:12:06,670
just settle things in the palace.

258
00:12:07,120 --> 00:12:07,640
All right?

259
00:12:23,280 --> 00:12:25,520
The Noble Consort is too soft
on Pei Zhao.

260
00:12:25,830 --> 00:12:27,100
If you kill him,

261
00:12:27,240 --> 00:12:28,960
won't she blame you?

262
00:12:29,550 --> 00:12:30,240
Impossible.

263
00:12:30,640 --> 00:12:31,680
She always does as I say.

264
00:12:32,450 --> 00:12:33,910
Without my support

265
00:12:34,030 --> 00:12:35,630
over these 18 years,

266
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:37,720
she'd never have kept her position.

267
00:12:38,030 --> 00:12:38,960
Who else

268
00:12:39,200 --> 00:12:40,150
can she rely on?

269
00:12:41,390 --> 00:12:42,670
When the Crown Prince takes the throne,

270
00:12:42,670 --> 00:12:43,670
he'll answer to me as well.

271
00:12:44,200 --> 00:12:45,080
Wise as always, Your Highness.

272
00:12:46,400 --> 00:12:47,500
I won this realm

273
00:12:47,790 --> 00:12:50,150
with armies at my back.

274
00:12:51,270 --> 00:12:52,480
I bled for it.

275
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:54,440
I didn't do all that to let these vermin

276
00:12:54,440 --> 00:12:55,390
stand in my way.

277
00:12:57,780 --> 00:13:01,100
[Blood Banquet Brewery]

278
00:13:06,450 --> 00:13:06,910
Brother.

279
00:13:07,970 --> 00:13:08,630
You're here.

280
00:13:10,540 --> 00:13:12,480
Did you hear Pei Zhao was attacked?

281
00:13:12,630 --> 00:13:13,240
Is he dead?

282
00:13:13,560 --> 00:13:14,220
Brother.

283
00:13:15,520 --> 00:13:16,600
Not yet?

284
00:13:17,550 --> 00:13:19,010
Hard to kill, isn't he?

285
00:13:20,480 --> 00:13:21,200
Brother.

286
00:13:21,320 --> 00:13:22,870
He's your future brother-in-law.

287
00:13:23,320 --> 00:13:24,570
He's not.

288
00:13:25,390 --> 00:13:26,840
You always defend him.

289
00:13:26,840 --> 00:13:28,150
Is he more important than me?

290
00:13:29,320 --> 00:13:30,720
Of course you're more important.

291
00:13:31,270 --> 00:13:32,540
I'm only worried

292
00:13:32,770 --> 00:13:34,090
you'll ruin things again.

293
00:13:35,790 --> 00:13:36,900
The Blood Sacrifice is near.

294
00:13:37,450 --> 00:13:38,360
You should

295
00:13:38,490 --> 00:13:40,120
focus on Yun Shao.

296
00:13:40,400 --> 00:13:41,720
You must not make any more mistakes.

297
00:13:41,890 --> 00:13:44,150
Yun Shao is nothing.
She's easy to handle.

298
00:13:46,130 --> 00:13:47,720
You should still be careful.

299
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:49,960
It's getting late.

300
00:13:49,960 --> 00:13:50,550
I have things to do.

301
00:13:56,440 --> 00:13:57,670
Aunt always says

302
00:13:57,670 --> 00:13:58,890
Yun Qi is unreliable.

303
00:13:59,740 --> 00:14:01,020
If I were a man,

304
00:14:01,460 --> 00:14:03,360
I'd achieve far more than him.

305
00:14:04,480 --> 00:14:05,440
What a shame.

306
00:14:06,200 --> 00:14:07,910
I was born a woman.

307
00:14:08,670 --> 00:14:10,670
I can only watch him cause trouble.

308
00:14:11,390 --> 00:14:12,960
My lady, where do we go now?

309
00:14:13,550 --> 00:14:14,790
Where else?

310
00:14:15,510 --> 00:14:17,150
Back home, of course.

311
00:14:18,790 --> 00:14:20,080
A woman's world

312
00:14:21,120 --> 00:14:22,550
is only this big.

313
00:14:25,050 --> 00:14:25,840
Thinking back,

314
00:14:26,120 --> 00:14:28,960
Yun Shao always begged me
to take her outside.

315
00:14:29,870 --> 00:14:31,480
She never knew

316
00:14:31,840 --> 00:14:33,320
how hard I fought

317
00:14:33,320 --> 00:14:35,000
to step outside.

318
00:14:36,080 --> 00:14:37,000
But she

319
00:14:38,120 --> 00:14:39,600
did nothing

320
00:14:39,890 --> 00:14:42,030
and got everything so easily.

321
00:14:42,470 --> 00:14:44,090
My lady outshines her by miles.

322
00:14:47,320 --> 00:14:49,720
She's a spoiled useless fool.

323
00:14:50,510 --> 00:14:52,600
So ungrateful.

324
00:14:54,390 --> 00:14:56,030
If her blood weren't useful,

325
00:14:56,630 --> 00:14:58,200
she'd never have lived this long.

326
00:15:00,150 --> 00:15:01,000
And now,

327
00:15:01,630 --> 00:15:03,750
she has Pei Zhao and the Crown Prince,

328
00:15:03,880 --> 00:15:04,750
and thinks

329
00:15:05,360 --> 00:15:06,670
she can stand above me.

330
00:15:09,140 --> 00:15:10,480
Ridiculous.

331
00:15:18,740 --> 00:15:20,370
Come take a look.

332
00:15:21,390 --> 00:15:22,490
Fresh pastries.

333
00:15:32,480 --> 00:15:33,870
How did you get Zhu Yi to help?

334
00:15:35,270 --> 00:15:37,390
I had Chang'an ask Ruoming

335
00:15:37,640 --> 00:15:39,080
for some leads.

336
00:15:40,070 --> 00:15:40,880
Zhu Yi has always

337
00:15:40,880 --> 00:15:42,260
had ties to the Yun family.

338
00:15:42,670 --> 00:15:44,080
They used him to buy back blood jade.

339
00:15:44,390 --> 00:15:44,940
Chang'an

340
00:15:44,940 --> 00:15:46,090
got the ledger

341
00:15:46,100 --> 00:15:46,900
and showed him the accounts.

342
00:15:47,360 --> 00:15:48,480
He agreed immediately.

343
00:15:51,090 --> 00:15:52,270
Ji Chang'an

344
00:15:52,750 --> 00:15:54,790
didn't tell me a thing.

345
00:15:56,150 --> 00:15:57,200
He was afraid

346
00:15:57,630 --> 00:15:59,200
you'd stop him seeing Ruoming.

347
00:16:00,670 --> 00:16:02,180
Looks like he listens to you more.

348
00:16:03,080 --> 00:16:03,600
Mm.

349
00:16:04,080 --> 00:16:05,080
He's a good boy.

350
00:16:06,200 --> 00:16:07,670
You praise him every day.

351
00:16:09,650 --> 00:16:10,910
I praise you too.

352
00:16:11,240 --> 00:16:11,840
Look.

353
00:16:12,150 --> 00:16:13,790
Without you and the Fengyi Bureau,

354
00:16:14,120 --> 00:16:15,390
who knows how greedy

355
00:16:15,630 --> 00:16:17,510
Yong's officials would be.

356
00:16:17,790 --> 00:16:19,670
The realm would be chaos.

357
00:16:20,080 --> 00:16:20,790
Am I right?

358
00:16:22,480 --> 00:16:23,630
No need to praise me.

359
00:16:24,000 --> 00:16:24,870
It's my duty.

360
00:16:26,030 --> 00:16:26,960
Let's go.

361
00:16:27,630 --> 00:16:29,050
Time for business.

362
00:16:34,030 --> 00:16:34,870
General Yun.

363
00:16:35,390 --> 00:16:37,000
Someone offered a huge price.

364
00:16:37,750 --> 00:16:38,670
This much.

365
00:16:39,150 --> 00:16:40,910
He wants a Blood Banquet.

366
00:16:42,340 --> 00:16:43,870
Who's being so generous?

367
00:16:45,120 --> 00:16:46,760
A wealthy merchant from the south.

368
00:16:50,600 --> 00:16:51,750
Here's the deposit.

369
00:16:52,910 --> 00:16:54,030
Gold?

370
00:16:55,720 --> 00:16:56,670
To invest so much...

371
00:16:56,670 --> 00:16:57,630
What for?

372
00:16:58,120 --> 00:17:00,320
To prolong his only son's life.

373
00:17:03,720 --> 00:17:05,310
Too risky right now.

374
00:17:06,710 --> 00:17:07,590
General Yun.

375
00:17:08,930 --> 00:17:10,070
Once it's done,

376
00:17:10,410 --> 00:17:12,430
you'll get 100,000 taels of gold.

377
00:17:15,590 --> 00:17:16,640
That's tempting.

378
00:17:16,640 --> 00:17:17,920
But I have no stock.

379
00:17:18,030 --> 00:17:19,680
Mingyu Headquarters is gone.

380
00:17:19,780 --> 00:17:20,920
Where do I get the goods?

381
00:17:22,510 --> 00:17:24,550
And Pei Zhao's been watching me.

382
00:17:25,070 --> 00:17:25,680
If we get caught,

383
00:17:25,680 --> 00:17:27,350
we're all finished.

384
00:17:28,960 --> 00:17:29,940
General Yun.

385
00:17:31,240 --> 00:17:32,340
You're worrying too much.

386
00:17:33,200 --> 00:17:34,460
As long as the Noble Consort is there,

387
00:17:34,720 --> 00:17:36,030
he can't touch you.

388
00:17:36,030 --> 00:17:37,240
As for the goods,

389
00:17:38,040 --> 00:17:39,110
who would know

390
00:17:39,110 --> 00:17:40,480
if they're real or fake,

391
00:17:40,480 --> 00:17:41,440
good or bad?

392
00:17:41,750 --> 00:17:43,890
That's entirely up to you.

393
00:17:48,110 --> 00:17:49,200
You mean

394
00:17:50,480 --> 00:17:52,510
use any girl as a substitute?

395
00:17:53,270 --> 00:17:54,110
General Yun.

396
00:17:55,180 --> 00:17:57,210
The Crown Prince's never liked the Yuns.

397
00:17:57,220 --> 00:17:58,840
Once he becomes Emperor,

398
00:17:59,440 --> 00:18:02,200
who knows what he'll do to you?

399
00:18:03,400 --> 00:18:05,070
Only with gold

400
00:18:06,030 --> 00:18:07,270
in your hands

401
00:18:07,440 --> 00:18:09,110
can you rest easy.

402
00:18:41,630 --> 00:18:44,440
♪A cold blade gleams by the window♪

403
00:18:46,060 --> 00:18:49,250
♪Candle tears harden into frost♪

404
00:18:50,570 --> 00:18:52,310
♪Moon shadows flicker and sway♪

405
00:18:52,810 --> 00:18:57,250
♪A wisp of longing haunts the air♪

406
00:18:59,410 --> 00:19:02,080
♪A lone boat rests on the misty river♪

407
00:19:03,300 --> 00:19:08,310
♪That promise lies sealed with my sword♪

408
00:19:08,630 --> 00:19:16,660
♪I turn to find the world in snow♪

409
00:19:16,930 --> 00:19:25,550
♪Fated destiny ties from bygone life♪

410
00:19:25,550 --> 00:19:34,220
♪Longing for one beloved flows on♪

411
00:19:34,600 --> 00:19:43,470
♪I can't let go of the verses lost
across this vast land♪

412
00:19:43,900 --> 00:19:52,390
♪Yet I let go of that fleeting light
within your eyes♪
